From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Frida Hou <Frida-a@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 06:24:29 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] [QW38] verify v2 stage B on the fold branch
 (VLLM_GDN_VERIFY_V2=1), incl. the deferred-commit verify

Port of the verify v2 stage B (chunked UT/WY verify, split-tf32
exact-operand MMAs, BV 64) to the fold verify (VLLM_GDN_RECOVER_FOLD=1):
phase 1 replays the previous step's pending records with the shipped serial
code (_gdn_replay_record + the int16 quantizer) on [SBV, BK] sub-tiles and stores
the folded state in place, then a CTA barrier; phase 2 re-reads the stored
state for the chunked verify (identical values; keeps the replay's registers
free). The folded state is bit-identical to the commit kernel's (fold poison gate
25/25 with the env set: fold-B == eager-B). Records/ring halves/single-buffered u
unchanged. Window > 1 and stage A ("A" is not ported here) use the shipped verify.
Knobs VLLM_GDN_VERIFY_V2_{BV,WARPS,PREC,SBV}. Proof: "GDN recover verify v2
(QW38 verify-v2): mode B fold (BV 64, warps 4, dot split)".

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
